<title>USA: Connecticut RRA, won by Fleet Sec.</title>
<headline>Connecticut RRA, won by Fleet Sec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Sec. said it won $8 million of Connecticut Resources Recovery Authority, Mid-Connecticut system bonds, 1997 Sereis A, with a true interest cost of 4.5782 percent.</p>
</text>
